/*
=================================================
STORED PROCEDURE FOR BRONZE
- Resets tables → Each Bronze table is truncated before loading.
- Loads raw data → BULK INSERT pulls CSVs from your source folders into the Bronze schema.
- Tracks timings → You’re capturing start/end times for each load and the overall batch.
- Error handling → The TRY…CATCH block prints an error message if something fails.

=================================================
*/
